## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Main
    * data
        * character
            * function
                * misc
                    + character_values_cut.mcfcuntion
                    > get_uuid.mcfcuntion


